  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster
    you control; it gains ATK equal to the difference between the number of cards
    in the Extra Decks x 100, until the end of this turn (even if this card leaves
    the field).\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nGains ATK during your turn only, and gains
    DEF during your opponent's turn only, each equal to the difference between the
    number of cards in the Extra Decks x 200. If this card attacks, it is changed
    to Defense Position at the end of the Battle Phase. If this card in the Monster
    Zone is destroyed: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone."
